B.NG=s(["Worked as a core Flutter developer on Triple 8 Go, building and extending major parts of the production driver application, including trip execution, logistics workflows, document handling, location tracking, payments-related workflows, notifications, and operational tools.","Built and extended major parts of the production Flutter application and its driver-facing workflows.","Developed and rebuilt complex current-trip and route-stop experiences for real-world dispatch execution.","Implemented a resilient background location tracking system with offline buffering, reverse geocoding, retry logic, connectivity-aware synchronization, and native platform service integration.","Built document scanning, image processing, PDF generation, preview, and upload workflows for driver paperwork.","Implemented the Exception Pay Request workflow, including dynamic adjustment types, conditional forms, evidence uploads, validation, and request history.","Implemented the multi-state leave-management workflow covering submission, changes, counters, extensions, cancellation, and return confirmation.","Built trip-pay estimate and adjustment-detail experiences with search and filtering.","Implemented expense and invoice submission workflows with receipt scanning, PDF processing, approver selection, and trip/asset context.","Implemented push notification handling and deep linking into relevant operational workflows.","Built fuel-price and fuel-station discovery features with map integration.","Worked across Android and iOS platform configurations and added compatibility handling for supported web environments."],t.s)
